SUMMARY:Jason: Boston\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Boston Pilgrimage\n\nStatus: Confirmed\nBoston Freedom Trail Ca
 tholic options saved from Jason: St. Leonard of Port Maurice\, 320 Hanover
  St\, is best for the North End / Paul Revere House / Old North area\; St.
  Joseph Catholic Church serves Government Center / North Station / Beacon H
 ill\; St. Anthony Shrine\, 100 Arch St\, is best for downtown/lunch-hour Ma
 ss and confession\; Our Lady of Good Voyage\, 51 Seaport Blvd\, is useful i
 f ending near Seaport/harbor. Old North Church is on the trail but Episcopa
 l\, not Catholic.\n\nView live: https://jstravelschedule.netlify.app
LOCATION:Boston\, MA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
